| Run        | WholePeriod        |
| Book       | business           |
| ReportKind | ItemizedCategories |
| From       | 2005-01-01         |
| To         | 2026-10-03         |
| Lines      | 4                  |
Then comparison summary is : ComparisonSummary CompareOnly
| Passes |
| true   |

