# The three periods
# ---------------------------------------------------------------------------

$WIP
Scenario The whole period, which is the migration test
Description Run first. A difference here is systematic, and the single number
Description that says the migration worked is that this passes.
Details The figures are transcribed from the PDF for the whole period. The
Details table below is the shape; the rows arrive with the PDF.
Given the quicken report states : QuickenFigure
| QuickenLine | QuickenAmount |
When reports compared : QuickenReport Vertical
| Run        | WholePeriod     |
| Book       | business        |
| ReportKind | SpendingByCategory |
| From       | 2005-01-01      |
| To         | 2026-10-03      |
| Lines      | 0               |
Then comparison summary is : ComparisonSummary CompareOnly
| Passes |
| true   |

$WIP
Scenario A full year, which tests how a report is bounded
Description 2025 is complete, so nothing about today affects it. A difference
Description here when the whole period agrees means a transaction is in the
Description wrong year, which is a date-reading fault rather than a missing
Description transaction.
Given the quicken report states : QuickenFigure
| QuickenLine | QuickenAmount |
When reports compared : QuickenReport Vertical
| Run        | FullYear2025    |
| Book        | business       |
| ReportKind | SpendingByCategory |
| From       | 2025-01-01      |
| To         | 2025-12-31      |
| Lines      | 0               |
Then comparison summary is : ComparisonSummary CompareOnly
| Passes |
| true   |

