Description Settled by the PDFs. All three populated reports carry their range
Description in the heading, and Year to Date reads "1/1/2026 through 10/3/2026",
Description which is today. So a part-year report stops at today and a
Description transaction dated later is excluded, even though it is in the
Description register. The All Dates report ends at today as well, not at the
Description last transaction in the file.
